            "review_title": "Review at Dong Ho Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Journey10419166128\n8 contributions\n0\nDelicious to the point of being amazing - the service staff are 5-star and very fast.\nAug 2026 • Couples\nFor a picky person like me, everyone, it's super delicious and the price is extremely beyond expectations compared to the product. I tried to only spend 88k for a taxi from the center, but I got everything in return. \nOur two couples went somewhere else but still insisted on coming back to eat the whole menu.\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten August 28, 2026",
