            "review_title": "Review at Dong Ho Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Екатерина\nNizhny Novgorod, Russia3 contributions\n0\nFresh seafood\nSep 2025 • Family\nThe restaurant they returned to for the second time. I think that's a benchmark for Vietnamese restaurants! \n1.Very fast serving. That's the fastest service I've ever seen. \n2. It's made with the freshest seafood. \n3. Service is of the highest standard. Waiters even open the cab door when you pull up. Everyone is very polite.\n4. In the middle of the restaurant - a fountain with live fish and turtles , the child was very interested.\n5. Special thanks to one of the waiters who helped us call a cab. Cars were failing one by one, and the waiter ordered a car from his phone. \n6. Most importantly, it's delicious! Fried seafood noodles and spring rolls with shrimp are delicious!!!!\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten September 25, 2025",
