            "review_title": "Review at Dong Ho Restaurant",
            "review_text": "FlyingDutchman71\nNaaldwijk, The Netherlands392 contributions\n0\nSuper vers\nMar 2025 • Couples\nJust ate delicious seafood. Tip order what you want first as an appetizer and leave the menu on the table, find out that otherwise you will get everything at once throughout Vietnam. \nSpringrolls with whole shrimp and grilled octopus was delicious.\nThen ordered fried rice with seafood and bbq Mantis shrimp. Requested help from the staff on how to remove such an animal from its bowl, after which he expertly \"demolished\" the whole plate.\nAccompanied by 4 Saigon beers and 2 Cokes, that will cost you € 27 no money for such a tasty and fresh dinner!\nRecommended!!\nRead more\nTranslated from Dutch\nShow original\nWritten March 29, 2025",
