            "review_text": "JW___\nSeoul, South Korea154 contributions\n0\nI could guarantee 100% satisfied family dinner!\nDec 2019 • Family\n100% 만족하면서 가족 저녁 식사 하였습니다. 저희 부모님부터 애기까지 좋아하네요.\nAll my family were really satisfied with dinner at this restaurant. It has reasonable price and great crews for family dinner\nWritten December 21, 2019\nLưu Tuấn Vũ\nWe are so happy to hear that all of you had a great time with us ! Thank you for coming us. Hope to see all of you again in the near future !\nWritten December 28, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
