            "review_text": "Kliko015\nDelft, The Netherlands4 contributions\n0\nGood food\nNov 2019 • Couples\nFound this place via googlemaps while we were doing our own foodtasting trip at the local restaurants. We ordered more then intended because the food is just great, both seafood and landbased. No nonsense, it is what it is. Good prices and just outside the over touristic part of Nha Trang. Service polite and friendly. 4 or 5 dishes are sufficient for 2 people. Decor is very basic but we loved the murals.\nRead more\nWritten November 13, 2019\nLưu Tuấn Vũ\nThank you for coming us! It's a good news that you had a great experience with us. We look forward to seeing you soon! \nBest regards\nDong Ho team\nRead more\nWritten November 17, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
